# A pump station's screen follows its water program: the line "water" of the machine's own screen
# is redrawn every 15 s from /run/urban/water/water.json. Started by urban-prepare for MODULE=water (the root
# is read-only, so it cannot be "enabled"). The redraw itself is urban-water-screen.service.
[Unit]
Description=URBAN OS: redraw the pump station's screen line

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=5s
OnUnitActiveSec=15s
AccuracySec=1s
Unit=urban-water-screen.service
